      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>Paco Dog Shop started with a simple idea: every dog deserves quality products and expert training. Founded by dog lovers, for dog lovers, we've grown from a small local shop into a trusted destination for pet parents who want the best for their furry companions.</p>

      <p>Named after Paco, our founder's beloved rescue dog, this shop represents everything we believe in - love, quality, and the bond between humans and their dogs.</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To provide dog owners with carefully curated, high-quality accessories and professional training services that strengthen the bond between dogs and their families.</p>

      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Curated Selection:</strong> Every product in our shop is tested and approved by our team of dog professionals.</li>
        <li><strong>Expert Training:</strong> Our certified trainers use positive reinforcement methods backed by behavioral science.</li>
        <li><strong>Community:</strong> We host monthly dog meetups, adoption events, and educational workshops.</li>
        <li><strong>Education:</strong> This project also serves as a teaching tool, helping students learn full-stack web development through a real-world business application.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
